          ┏ Command palette ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓
          ┃  type to search actions and requests, or : for commands                                     1/70 ┃
          ┃                                                                                                  ┃
          ┃ Show all keys and actions                                                          F1 / Ctrl+W ? ┃
          ┃ Send the request (or start the gRPC call)                                        Ctrl+Enter / F5 ┃
          ┃ Cancel the running request or stream                                                    Ctrl+W x ┃
          ┃ Finish sending on a client/bidi stream (half-close)                                     Ctrl+W d ┃
          ┃ Save the request to its file (asks for a name if new)                          Ctrl+S / Ctrl+W s ┃
          ┃ Quit Sendito                                                                   Ctrl+W q / Ctrl+Q ┃
          ┃ Open a new unsaved HTTP request tab                                            Ctrl+N / Ctrl+W t ┃
          ┃ Open a new unsaved gRPC request tab                                                     Ctrl+W g ┃
          ┃ Close the current tab                                                                   Ctrl+W c ┃
          ┃ Next open request tab                                                   Ctrl+W n / Ctrl+PageDown ┃
          ┃ Previous open request tab                                                 Ctrl+W p / Ctrl+PageUp ┃
          ┃ Focus the pane to the left                                                Ctrl+W h / Ctrl+W Left ┃
          ┃ Focus the pane below                                                      Ctrl+W j / Ctrl+W Down ┃
          ┃ Focus the pane above                                                        Ctrl+W k / Ctrl+W Up ┃
          ┃ Focus the pane to the right                                              Ctrl+W l / Ctrl+W Right ┃
          ┃ Next tab of the focused pane (e.g. Params → Headers)                                    Ctrl+W ] ┃
          ┃ Previous tab of the focused pane                                                        Ctrl+W [ ┃
          ┃ Jump to tab 1 of the focused pane                                                          Alt+1 ┃
          ┃ Jump to tab 2 of the focused pane                                                          Alt+2 ┃
          ┃ Jump to tab 3 of the focused pane                                                          Alt+3 ┃
          ┃ Jump to tab 4 of the focused pane                                                          Alt+4 ┃
          ┃ Jump to tab 5 of the focused pane                                                          Alt+5 ┃
